    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for an endless onslaught of the undead in Mortalis Meltdown, a heart-pounding, action-packed top-down zombie shooter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the thrill of survival as you face wave after wave of relentless zombies, their numbers growing ever larger and their hunger for flesh never-ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortalis Meltdown is the ultimate test of your zombie-slaying prowess. Can you survive the endless onslaught and emerge as the ultimate undead hunter?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless waves of zombies that you need to outmaneuver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain points for kills, compete against a leaderboard</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple weapons that are upgradable</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect health packs to stay alive</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty increases as the game progresses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase additional characters to play as</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mortalis Meltdown is a work in progress. Stay put for more updates.</p>",
